Today is Thursday.
It is now seven o'clock in the evening.
I am coming from the gym.
My time at the gym is always half past five.
Afterwards, I go to the bicycle shop.
The mechanic is there.
I say to him - "Hello, brother."
"Is my bicycle ready?"
He says - "Yes, your bicycle is here."
"You arrive on time."
It is very good.
I do not ride the bicycle every day.
I ride it only sometimes.
But now it is like new.
He always does good work.
I say to him - "Thank you, brother."
"You do the work on time."
He smiles happily.
I take the bicycle.
I go home by bicycle.
